# Inset Faces: una cara, la region entera, individual, sin borde (plano), profundidad, outset, undo y el modal
window 1280 720
add cube
mode edit
selmode face
select face 0
inset 0.2
undo
select all
inset 0.1 individual
undo
inset 0.2 corner onsurface
undo
inset 0.2 corner onsurface nouniform
undo
select face 0
inset 0.2 0.3 seloutside
undo
select face 0
inset 0.2 outside rail relative nointerp nouniform
undo
mode object
add plane
mode edit
selmode face
select all
inset 0.2
undo
select face 0
inset modal 80
undo
